<title>JAPAN: Muto Seiko - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Muto Seiko - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.72		vs	    3.29</p>
<p> Operating	   95    million	  vs	   48    million</p>
<p> Current	     84    million	  vs	   31    million</p>
<p> Net		   41    million	  vs	    3    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.98 yen	  vs	    0.67 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Muto Seiko Co is a manufacturer of plastic parts.</p>
